[661.176,"o","ov stack destroy -y --delete-data\r\n"]
[661.208,"o","── PLAN · nothing below has run ───────────────────────────────────────\r\nThis is what will be deleted from your DigitalOcean account:\r\n\r\n  # Everything the Terraform state in .openvidu/digitalocean holds: the four master\r\n  # Droplets, the media node Droplets, the load balancer, the VPC, the firewalls, the\r\n  # tags, the autoscaler's Function (its namespace and its trigger) and the media nodes it\r\n  # created, the SSH key, the Spaces key, the Spaces (the recordings and Meet data in one,\r\n  # the cluster's metrics and logs in the other). A Space must be empty to go, and the\r\n  # master writes into it until it is gone, so the Spaces are emptied between two passes;\r\n  # only a Space the state holds is emptied, never one of your own (SpaceName).\r\n  # The media nodes the autoscaler created are not in the state: the template's destroy\r\n  # deletes them by their tags, with the API token in DIGITALOCEAN_TOKEN.\r\n  # OPENVIDU_STACK_DESTROY=1 tells it the whole stack goes, so no media node drains first.\r\n  terraform -chdir=.openvidu/digitalocean init -input=false -no-color -force-copy\r\n  env OPENVIDU_STACK_DESTROY=1 terraform -chdir=.openvidu/digitalocean destroy -auto-approve -input=false -no-color\r\n  env AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=$SPACES_ACCESS_KEY_ID AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=$SPACES_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY AWS_SESSION_TOKEN= aws s3 rm s3://openvidu-e2e-do-ha-s132741-space-appdata-849e62d6e5 --recursive --endpoint-url https://fra1.digitaloceanspaces.com\r\n  env AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=$SPACES_ACCESS_KEY_ID AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=$SPACES_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY AWS_SESSION_TOKEN= aws s3 rm s3://openvidu-e2e-do-ha-s132741-space-clusterdata-849e62d6e5 --recursive --endpoint-url https://fra1.digitaloceanspaces.com\r\n  env OPENVIDU_STACK_DESTROY=1 terraform -chdir=.openvidu/digitalocean destroy -auto-approve -input=false -no-color\r\n\r\n--delete-data: the recordings and Meet data, and the cluster's metrics and logs, are in the stack's two Spaces: this deletes them.\r\n── end of plan ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n"]
